OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power as rain
OL,4,Aand wind continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes are without power,
OL,7,Fand disruption is continuing across
OL,8,FDevon and Cornwall after more stormy
OL,9,Fweather.
OL,11,FOn Friday, Storm Austen battered the
OL,12,Fsouth-west of England before moving to
OL,13,Fother parts of the UK.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, the Met Office issued a
OL,16,Fyellow weather warning for heavy rain
OL,17,Ffrom 11:00 BST until 23:00 for the
OL,18,FSouth West, in association with Storm
OL,19,FBoelo.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
