OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power as rain
OL,4,Aand wind continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Devon and Cornwall, flights and
OL,7,Ftrains have been cancelled. The
OL,8,FNational Grid said more than 3,200
OL,9,Fproperties were without power in
OL,10,FCornwall, and more than 760 in Devon.
